Z||000000||RossT||01-30-2001||08:55 PM||||Ok, this is a follow un on a previous thread about installing new pontiac up3 cd player into a fiero. Tgowens pics gave me the "I want it" for that deck.  Following Batboys suggestion I found a deck on another forum.  Now I need some help. I have the GM wire adapter.  BUT WHERE DO ALL THE WIRES GO!!  The wire adapter did not come with instructions. Here are some pics:<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Image014_1.jpg">  The famous UP3<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Image015.jpg">  Back of the deck with wire harness adapter<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Image017.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Image018_1.jpg"> <P>My question is, on the up3 side there are 3 plugs, as you can see, I found where 2 of them go, but the third does not fit anywhere. The black plug with red clip on it looks like it belongs to the upper right, but it does not fit there!!  <P>There are 3 plugs also on the fiero harness side. Are all three of these used?<P>Future questions will be:<BR>1. stock fireo subwoofer wiring.  I think I found how to spice the pink wires on a previous thread.<P>2. Theft lock.  The previous owner claims that the unit theftlock was disabled, but It has been without power for a long time. I think I found how to get the backup codes, if needed I may need help to get the unlock codes when I power up.<P>Sorry so long,  Thanks to all, especially tgowens, fiero64, and Batboy.||||reg||1
Z||000001||DXR_DAD||01-30-2001||09:08 PM||||Thanks Ross, Just wanted to let you know....<P>I'm feelin the love!!!!!!!!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>DXR_DAD||||reg||12
